<title>USA: Ameritech selling on-line yellow page ads.</title>
<headline>Ameritech selling on-line yellow page ads.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp said Monday it has begun selling advertising space for its soon-to-be-introduced on-line yellow pages service.</p>
<p>Ameritech also will design and develop web sites for its clients.</p>
<p>It said the electronic version of its listings will complement printed directories.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
